WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.975
Before severe weather, choose a shelter place.

00:00:02.975 --> 00:00:08.020
In a sturdy house, the interior of a basement is the safest place in the home.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.508
Stay away from windows.

00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:14.876
If a house has no basement, use an inside room without windows on the lowest floor.

00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:17.269
Do not plan to stay in a mobile home.

00:00:17.269 --> 00:00:19.080
That is a different setting.
